# Local CI (act) configuration.
#
# Read from THIS directory: the wrapper scripts (`run.ps1` / `run.sh`) change
# into this folder before invoking act so this file (and `.act.env`) is picked
# up, then point act at the repository root with `-C ..`.

# Runner image for `runs-on:` (host) jobs. `catthehacker/ubuntu:act-latest` is
# the community-standard full-featured GitHub-runner image (git, docker CLI,
# compose). The `container:` jobs in `.forgejo/workflows/ci.yml`
# (rust:1.89-bookworm, semgrep/semgrep) use their own images regardless of
# this mapping.
-P ubuntu-latest=catthehacker/ubuntu:act-latest

# Match the host CPU architecture. Apple Silicon / ARM64 hosts must use
# linux/arm64 instead; Docker Desktop on x86 Windows keeps linux/amd64.
--container-architecture linux/amd64

# Local environment defaults (committed with safe values; edit locally or
# copy `.act.env.example` over it for overrides).
--env-file .act.env